---
layout: layouts/home.njk
title: Home
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
eleventyImport:
  collections: ["allPosts", "writing", "notes", "letters"]
---
{#- The homepage (after psyche.co): the intro, then making as two rows of
    big pairs under a "Making" title that fades in on scroll, writing (and
    letters) in its own band, Reading + Notes side by side, and the letters
    sign-up above the footer. Art is never cropped: each card in a row grows
    in proportion to its image's width÷height (--r), so a row shares one
    height and every image keeps its real shape. Cards fade up as they
    scroll into view (CSS only). Styles: _home.scss. #}
{%- from "components/home-cards.njk" import more, storyCard as card %}

{#- the big pairs: the four newest pieces of making (sections.making in
    _data/sections.js) with a picture, newest first #}
{%- set arts = [] %}
{%- for post in collections.allPosts | inSections(sections.making) %}
  {%- if arts.length < 4 and (post | cardImageAny) %}{% set arts = (arts.push(post), arts) %}{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}

{#- writing: the three newest of writing + letters together. If they're all
    letters, the third slot goes to the newest piece of writing instead #}
{%- set writes = collections.allPosts | inSections(["writing", "letters"]) | head(3) %}
{%- set latestWriting = (collections.writing | notInSections(["letters"]))[0] %}
{%- if latestWriting and not (writes | notInSections(["letters"])).length %}
  {%- set writes = (writes | head(2)).concat([latestWriting]) %}
{%- endif %}

{%- include "components/home-intro.njk" %}

{#- the Making title (and View all) stay hidden at the top of the page, so
    only the pictures peek up on first load; they fade in once you scroll
    a little (CSS, "Making title" in _home.scss) #}
<header class="home-head home-making-head"><h2><a href="/making/">Making</a></h2>{{ more("/making/", "View all") }}</header>
{%- for pair in arts | batch(2) %}
<section class="home-top ratio-row{% if loop.first %} home-first-row{% endif %}">
  {%- for post in pair %}{{ card(post, "", true) }}{% endfor %}
</section>
{%- endfor %}

{#- writing: its own full-width band, small images (a pasted screenshot shows as text
    only; letters use the first picture in the letter), each labelled with
    its first tag rather than "Writing" every time — letters are labelled
    "Letters" #}
<section class="home-band is-tint">
  <header class="home-head"><h2>Writing</h2>{{ more("/writing/", "View all") }}</header>
  <div class="home-writing-grid">
    {%- for post in writes %}
    {%- set t = post | cardImageAny %}
    {{- card(post, "is-compact", true, t and not ("Pasted" in t.src), not ("letters" in post.data.section)) }}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{#- Reading and Notes side by side #}
<section class="home-band">
  <div class="home-pair">
    <div>
      <header class="home-head"><h2>Reading</h2>{{ more("/reading/", "Bookshelf") }}</header>
      <div>
        {#- covers only, side by side and left-aligned, so one or two books
            look as settled as three; the title is in the alt text and tooltip #}
        <div class="home-covers">
          {%- for b in "reading" | shelfCards | head(3) %}
          {%- set thumb = b | cardImage %}
          <a href="{{ b.url }}" title="{{ b.data.title }}">
            {%- if thumb %}<img src="{{ thumb.src }}" alt="{{ b.data.title }}" loading="lazy"{% if thumb.remote %} eleventy:ignore{% endif %}>{% else %}<span class="home-cover-blank">{{ b.data.title }}</span>{% endif -%}
          </a>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <header class="home-head"><h2>Notes</h2>{{ more("/notes/", "The garden") }}</header>
      {#- one row per note: title, with its first topic tag on the right #}
      <ul class="home-notes">
        {%- for post in collections.notes | head(5) %}
        {%- set topic = false %}
        {%- for t in post.data.tags or [] %}{% if not topic and t != "notes" %}{% set topic = t %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        <li><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>{% if topic %}<span class="home-notes-topic">{{ topic }}</span>{% endif %}</li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- letters: the sign-up panel, one centred column, above the footer #}
{%- set signupLayout = "stacked" %}
{%- set signupAtEnd = true %}
{% include "components/letters-signup.njk" %}
